---
// No props — static decision-oriented tool cards.
---

<section class="breed-decision-shortcuts" aria-labelledby="breed-shortcuts-title">
  <div class="breed-directory-container">
    <h2 id="breed-shortcuts-title" class="sr-only">Planning tools</h2>
    <div class="breed-decision-shortcuts__grid">
      <a href="/tools/breed-match" class="breed-decision-shortcut">
        <span class="breed-decision-shortcut__icon" aria-hidden="true">🧭</span>
        <strong>I need help choosing</strong>
        <p>Answer a few questions to find breeds that may fit your lifestyle.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/tools/compare" class="breed-decision-shortcut">
        <span class="breed-decision-shortcut__icon" aria-hidden="true">⚖️</span>
        <strong>I'm comparing breeds</strong>
        <p>Compare traits, care needs and costs side by side.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/tools/puppy-cost" class="breed-decision-shortcut">
        <span class="breed-decision-shortcut__icon" aria-hidden="true">💰</span>
        <strong>I'm planning a puppy</strong>
        <p>Estimate first-year costs: food, vet, grooming, supplies and more.</p>
      </a>
      <a href="/tools/puppy-supplies" class="breed-decision-shortcut">
        <span class="breed-decision-shortcut__icon" aria-hidden="true">📋</span>
        <strong>I want a checklist</strong>
        <p>Get a breed-specific puppy supplies checklist before you bring them home.</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
